# Theme

Narrative and token roles: [docs/theme.md](../../docs/theme.md). Read it before changing site chrome or colors.

## Must preserve

- Put brand hex / palette mixes only in `[data-theme='…']` (or `:root`) value blocks in `src/app.css` — structure rules must use `var(--*)` only (darken with `var(--ink)`, not bare `black` / `#000`).
- Shipping theme is **baglio** (`data-theme` on `<html>`). Alternates (anti-brochure `oggi`) are experimental until promoted; register ids in `SITE_THEMES` and do not invent accents outside a theme block.
- Honor the triad luminance contract: light `--paper`/`--surface`, deep `--sea`/`--sea-deep`, mid `--olive` — do not invert light/dark with tokens alone.
- Keep the baglio character while it ships: paper ground, `--sea` action, `--olive` meta; Fraunces + Figtree; `--radius: 2px`.
- Text on sea / dark bands uses `--on-sea`; raised interactive tiles use `--surface`; soft media overlays use `--wash`.
- Cards only for interactive affordances (house tiles, forms) — not default editorial layout.
- Pills (`999px`) only for media controls; do not theme the archive browser.
- Theme probe stays a temporary native `<select>` in the header (`.theme-pick`) — no product styling; remove when experiments end; no purple / cream-terracotta / broadsheet restyle of the shipping theme.
- Do not rewrite favicon or `theme-color` on toggle; video letterbox uses `--void`; Leaflet zoom/attribution in `ArriveMap` stays on theme tokens.
